# Runtime logo uploads, not source. The real fix is env.LOGO_DIR plus the test-mode guard in
# assets.service; this is belt-and-braces so a stray `git add .` cannot commit user uploads the
# way 12 test-generated files were committed before (removed in cf11727).
#
# Deliberately NOT retroactive: 088f2e63-8f49-4a03-8af6-fd46fcbe6f13.webp is already tracked and
# stays tracked — gitignore does not untrack files, and untracking it would leave a fresh clone
# unable to render the logo on KW-2026-000002, the only real order.
public/static/logos/
